                            <comment id="17928308" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Wed, 19 Feb 2025 07:32:56 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When setting attributes, an external user object was used, so the update did not use the original object, resulting in no actual update.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Use the correct object to set attributes.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
